All right. Come here. Come here.

981
01:23:57.366 --> 01:23:59.289
You're gonna be all right.

982
01:24:01.453 --> 01:24:03.330
- Hey!
- Jesus Christ, Bill.

983
01:24:03.497 --> 01:24:06.171
Your brat and his gang of hooligans
attacked my kid.

984
01:24:06.333 --> 01:24:08.176
- Watch your tone, doctor.
- Oh, really?

985
01:24:08.335 --> 01:24:10.758
Easy. We don't need
another school-yard brawl.

986
01:24:10.921 --> 01:24:13.549
- I'm sorry the children got into a scuffle.
- A scuffle?

987
01:24:13.715 --> 01:24:15.058
No easy way to say this...

988
01:24:15.217 --> 01:24:18.642
...but we think it would be best
if you remove the children from school.

989
01:24:18.804 --> 01:24:20.852
- What?
- Molly, you know us. We're friends.

990
01:24:21.014 --> 01:24:22.174
- Olive, stop...
- Don't.

991
01:24:22.224 --> 01:24:25.068
I'm sorry.
Your kids are a bad influence.

992
01:24:25.227 --> 01:24:28.527
- That's not true. How can you say that?
- It's not the children's fault.

993
01:24:29.982 --> 01:24:31.905
It's your fault.

994
01:24:32.067 --> 01:24:35.071
You're passing your life off as normal,
and it's not.

995
01:24:35.237 --> 01:24:37.535
You can live your life
however you want.

996
01:24:37.698 --> 01:24:41.043
But when it comes to my kids,
I don't want them exposed to...

997
01:24:42.494 --> 01:24:44.246
...people like you.

998
01:24:47.124 --> 01:24:48.922
Elizabeth.

999
01:24:53.589 --> 01:24:55.557
Fucking freaks.

1000
01:24:58.802 --> 01:25:01.180
- What did you call us?
- Called you perverts.

1001
01:25:05.100 --> 01:25:06.773
- No!
- Bill!

1002
01:25:07.311 --> 01:25:09.405
- Stop it!
- Get off of him. Get off!

1003
01:25:13.317 --> 01:25:15.285
- Violence.
- What of it?

1004
01:25:17.029 --> 01:25:18.531
Fred!

1005
01:25:19.156 --> 01:25:20.842
- Are you all right?
- Yeah.

1006
01:25:20.866 --> 01:25:24.086
Try to get up and be somewhat careful.

1007
01:25:25.329 --> 01:25:27.923
Don't. It's not worth it.

1008
01:25:29.499 --> 01:25:30.671
No more.

1009
01:25:30.834 --> 01:25:34.134
Wonder Woman <i>is filled with violence...</i>

1010
01:25:34.296 --> 01:25:37.140
<i>...torture and sadomasochism.</i>

1011
01:25:42.137 --> 01:25:45.061
You know, I was wrong to fight today.

1012
01:25:45.515 --> 01:25:49.986
But what you must understand
is what's more important than fists.

1013
01:25:50.646 --> 01:25:52.569
It's what's in here.

1014
01:25:53.607 --> 01:25:55.735
Ideas, thoughts...

1015
01:25:56.151 --> 01:25:58.950
...that's more powerful than force.

1016
01:26:00.447 --> 01:26:02.290
Do you understand
what I'm saying to you?

1017
01:26:03.408 --> 01:26:04.580
Yes, sir.

1018
01:26:04.993 --> 01:26:06.370
Good.

1019
01:26:10.123 --> 01:26:11.670
- Good night.
- Good night.

1020
01:26:14.503 --> 01:26:16.426
I landed a few.

1021
01:26:45.409 --> 01:26:48.128
The kids are asleep, finally.

1022
01:26:48.787 --> 01:26:50.255
And Bill?

1023
01:26:50.914 --> 01:26:52.587
Him too.

1024
01:27:00.132 --> 01:27:01.805
We can't keep doing this.

1025
01:27:04.344 --> 01:27:06.847
Are you blaming me for what happened?

1026
01:27:08.098 --> 01:27:10.897
- They had no right to...
- No, they did.

1027
01:27:11.059 --> 01:27:12.276
They have every right.

1028
01:27:12.436 --> 01:27:13.779
Their right to shun us...

1029
01:27:13.937 --> 01:27:16.486
...and perhaps their right to beat us.

1030
01:27:17.941 --> 01:27:21.036
Not because we fuck each other,
but because we're foolish enough...

1031
01:27:21.194 --> 01:27:23.617
...to think that we're better than them.

1032
01:27:24.990 --> 01:27:27.288
I'm not a scientist.

1033
01:27:27.993 --> 01:27:30.166
I'm a secretary.

1034
01:27:30.328 --> 01:27:34.003
And Bill is not a psychologist.
He writes comic books.

1035
01:27:34.166 --> 01:27:35.884
And you...

1036
01:27:39.963 --> 01:27:42.261
I don't know what you are.

1037
01:27:48.847 --> 01:27:50.690
Please don't do this.

1038
01:27:53.977 --> 01:27:55.820
You have to go.

1039
01:28:20.170 --> 01:28:22.093
Please don't.

1040
01:28:24.090 --> 01:28:25.763
I don't wanna go.

1041
01:28:25.926 --> 01:28:27.894
It's gonna be all right. It's okay.

1042
01:28:28.053 --> 01:28:29.680
I won't get in any more fights.

1043
01:28:29.846 --> 01:28:33.567
Sweetheart,
I told you it wasn't about that, okay?

1044
01:28:37.103 --> 01:28:39.356
You be a big boy, okay?

1045
01:28:45.654 --> 01:28:48.999
It's all right, Byrne.
You look after your brother, all right?

1046
01:28:51.827 --> 01:28:54.706
- Please don't do this.
- I didn't do this.

1047
01:30:16.161 --> 01:30:17.959
Love you, Mom.

1048
01:30:23.501 --> 01:30:24.969
Hey, Mommy.

1049
01:30:27.714 --> 01:30:29.967
I'll come pick them up on Sunday.

1050
01:30:44.606 --> 01:30:47.200
<i>You gotta go to the review,
or they can shut us down.</i>

1051
01:30:47.359 --> 01:30:50.613
- Absolutely not. This is un-American.
- I got this bitch on my ass.

1052
01:30:50.779 --> 01:30:53.658
- I don't care.
- I'm not gonna let you sink this ship!

1053
01:31:01.373 --> 01:31:04.377
<i>Burn them! Burn them! Burn them!</i>

1054
01:31:10.507 --> 01:31:13.386
Look, I have explained
my methodology.

1055
01:31:13.551 --> 01:31:15.599
What troubles me is
that you're trying out...

1056
01:31:15.762 --> 01:31:19.608
...your so-called
psychological experiment on children.

1057
01:31:19.766 --> 01:31:21.393
Children are our great hope.

1058
01:31:21.559 --> 01:31:24.563
Do you let your children read it'?
Your little girl?

1059
01:31:24.729 --> 01:31:26.777
I don't know
why your wife puts up with it.

1060
01:31:26.940 --> 01:31:30.285
- This and the other woman...
- You leave my family out of it.

1061
01:31:35.991 --> 01:31:38.540
Who are you to judge us?

1062
01:31:58.930 --> 01:32:00.648
Are you normal?

1063
01:32:17.323 --> 01:32:21.169
- Doctor, what is it? What's wrong?
- He's gonna be okay. Stay back.

1064
01:32:58.573 --> 01:32:59.950
<i>Hello?</i>

1065
01:33:02.327 --> 01:33:03.795
<i>Hello?</i>

1066
01:33:08.541 --> 01:33:09.588
Olive?

1067
01:34:35.295 --> 01:34:38.765
Bill, she's not coming back.

1068
01:34:38.923 --> 01:34:40.266
She said she'd come.

1069
01:34:49.559 --> 01:34:50.651
Sorry to be late.

1070
01:34:54.314 --> 01:34:55.987
Thank you for coming.

1071
01:35:03.323 --> 01:35:06.998
- Do you need help with your suitcase?
- No, no.

1072
01:35:08.494 --> 01:35:10.167
I...

1073
01:35:11.122 --> 01:35:13.341
I wanted to...

1074
01:35:14.959 --> 01:35:17.712
Dear, I was wondering
if it would be possible for me...

1075
01:35:17.879 --> 01:35:20.177
...to speak for three minutes
without you interrupting me.

1076
01:35:23.426 --> 01:35:24.894
Sure.

1077
01:35:26.554 --> 01:35:28.147
Olive...

1078
01:35:29.974 --> 01:35:33.353
...I've often thought
of what I wanted to say to you...

1079
01:35:33.519 --> 01:35:36.113
- ...what I wished I'd said to you.
- I'm sorry, this...

1080
01:35:36.606 --> 01:35:39.576
- This really isn't necessary.
- Please.

1081
01:35:45.573 --> 01:35:48.292
Elizabeth was wrong.
She can't live without you.

1082
01:35:48.451 --> 01:35:50.451
- Bill, will you shut it?
- Three minutes.

1083
01:35:50.578 --> 01:35:53.001
- Not if you're gonna misrepresent me.
- I'm dying.

1084
01:35:53.164 --> 01:35:54.837
Not yet. You don't speak for me.

1085
01:35:54.999 --> 01:35:57.172
I am not. I'm speaking for myself.

1086
01:35:57.335 --> 01:35:58.415
I'm sorry. I can't do this.

1087
01:35:58.544 --> 01:36:02.299
- You asked me to come. Now, I'm going.
- Please don't go.

1088
01:36:06.427 --> 01:36:08.805
I have made a new life for myself, Bill.

1089
01:36:08.972 --> 01:36:10.815
But are you happy?

1090
01:36:12.517 --> 01:36:15.396
- Does it matter?
- Of course it matters.

1091
01:36:15.937 --> 01:36:18.281
You gave up. The both of you.

1092
01:36:20.525 --> 01:36:22.573
I'm going to die...

1093
01:36:22.735 --> 01:36:26.160
...and you will be left all alone
with your bitterness...

1094
01:36:26.322 --> 01:36:28.996
...and your rage
and your knowledge that you loved her...

1095
01:36:29.701 --> 01:36:32.955
...and she loved you,
and you threw it away for them.

1096
01:36:33.121 --> 01:36:37.046
Our kids don't deserve to be attacked,
to be ostracized.

1097
01:36:37.208 --> 01:36:40.212
Our children are inheriting your shame.

1098
01:36:40.628 --> 01:36:43.097
Is that how you want them to live?

1099
01:36:45.508 --> 01:36:48.182
Is that the lesson you want
to teach them?

1100
01:36:51.139 --> 01:36:52.265
Now, do you love her?

1101
01:37:01.566 --> 01:37:03.944
- Yes.
- And have you always?

1102
01:37:04.110 --> 01:37:05.703
Yes.

1103
01:37:05.862 --> 01:37:07.864
So then ask her.

1104
01:37:28.718 --> 01:37:30.265
Olive...

1105
01:37:33.431 --> 01:37:35.399
...will you forgive me?

1106
01:37:38.353 --> 01:37:39.900
No.

1107
01:37:42.065 --> 01:37:44.864
- No?
- No.

1108
01:37:45.026 --> 01:37:48.951
- You need to submit to her.
- I don't know what you're talking about.

1109
01:37:49.113 --> 01:37:53.163
You cannot win every argument.
You cannot dominate all the time.

1110
01:37:53.326 --> 01:37:55.545
- Get on your knees.
- I will not. This is absurd.

1111
01:37:55.703 --> 01:37:58.377
- Get on your knees.
- I...

1112
01:38:33.699 --> 01:38:36.168
Olive, please forgive me.

1113
01:38:37.703 --> 01:38:39.376
More.

1114
01:38:46.254 --> 01:38:48.632
Please take us back.

1115
01:38:55.388 --> 01:38:57.982
I thought I knew everything.

1116
01:39:01.602 --> 01:39:05.573
I thought love wasn't enough.

1117
01:39:06.107 --> 01:39:07.529
But it...

1118
01:39:08.067 --> 01:39:12.163
It has to. It has to be enough
because we cannot...

1119
01:39:13.156 --> 01:39:15.284
We cannot live without you.

1120
01:39:26.669 --> 01:39:29.798
I cannot live without you.

1121
01:39:37.680 --> 01:39:39.432
Please...

1122
01:39:42.185 --> 01:39:44.529
...come back to us.

1123
01:39:53.488 --> 01:39:55.661
I want a new stove.

1124
01:39:58.576 --> 01:39:59.919
What?

1125
01:40:00.703 --> 01:40:03.752
The one you have is ancient,
and the back burners don't work.

1126
01:40:04.707 --> 01:40:06.550
We can get a new stove.

1127
01:40:06.709 --> 01:40:09.713
I want you to take the kids
on weekends.

1128
01:40:10.087 --> 01:40:13.762
I have to look after them all week,
and I'd like some time to myself...

1129
01:40:13.925 --> 01:40:16.178
...to go to the salon or read a book.

1130
01:40:17.136 --> 01:40:19.434
- Okay.
- And change Wonder Woman's outfit.

1131
01:40:19.597 --> 01:40:20.849
It's preposterous.

1132
01:40:21.474 --> 01:40:23.067
There I must draw the line.

1133
01:40:27.396 --> 01:40:30.525
I want you to love me
for all of my days.

1134
01:40:35.154 --> 01:40:36.781
All right.

1135
01:41:16.737 --> 01:41:20.116
My name is
Dr. William Moulton Marston.

1136
01:41:20.575 --> 01:41:23.704
And I am the creator of Wonder Woman.

1137
01:41:23.869 --> 01:41:25.746
Wonder Woman is a love letter.

1138
01:41:26.163 --> 01:41:27.460
She is a fantasy.

1139
01:41:27.623 --> 01:41:30.923
She comes from a distant place
where there is beauty...

1140
01:41:31.419 --> 01:41:34.093
<i>...and justice, and respect.</i>

1141
01:41:34.255 --> 01:41:37.600
<i>I write what I see
about women I know...</i>

1142
01:41:37.758 --> 01:41:40.102
<i>...women who are every bit as just...</i>

1143
01:41:40.261 --> 01:41:44.107
<i>...and strong,
and capable as Wonder Woman.</i>

1144
01:41:44.265 --> 01:41:46.859
<i>Now, we can debate
the length of her hemline.</i>

1145
01:41:47.018 --> 01:41:49.362
But what is important...

1146
01:41:49.520 --> 01:41:52.865
...is the way
Wonder Woman reforms criminals.

1147
01:41:54.483 --> 01:41:56.611
She makes them tell the truth.

1148
01:41:56.777 --> 01:41:59.371
That is what she stands for...

1149
01:42:00.156 --> 01:42:01.749
...the truth.

1150
01:42:02.742 --> 01:42:04.244
To you...

1151
01:42:05.369 --> 01:42:09.124
...Wonder Woman is just a comic...

1152
01:42:10.958 --> 01:42:12.960
...but she's my life.

1153
01:42:15.212 --> 01:42:17.089
She's my love.
